&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/aPki-gyNodEyiXE6CVNs5ep9CHRqHcBVJpbowIeyVgRTwMvFzVD-hpgGk1a3CLSvyF4MNa_6-81UgqjfRzKE05k5j4_6MpkIt2j8tkMcP4n7j-wh5Ud1ddDB2zvc5tdXLUfYDrwyjjKOheIAVetnOYX2-GPrEIg-fy1r-BPp5jQA6Q-7FOsAx3YXpN1wzvy-OsMBzzS-yJNtFKh1f1J5-etqDaPBhMrm6isuG8786d2QqdtEKJeP6Wx6mGgdbFF4ckMH20XiI8ZmLWLnXTxC4ENw5PkcvyVm_ykadcKdMvkySCpB9JBbcnJ4sd_oQTauL0Dc9TPN4qIVdyJO1Sckfg.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
